@startuml
title ATM State Diagram

[*] --> Idle : Card Inserted

state Idle
state PINEntry
state Options
state Processing
state CardRetained
state Cancelled

Idle --> PINEntry : PIN Entry Requested

PINEntry --> PINEntry : Incorrect PIN\nattempts < maxAttempts

PINEntry --> CardRetained : Incorrect PIN\nattempts >= maxAttempts

PINEntry --> Options : PIN Correct

PINEntry --> Cancelled : Cancel Requested

Options --> Processing : Selection Made

Options --> Cancelled : Cancel Requested

Processing --> Idle : Request Completed

CardRetained --> Idle : Timeout

Cancelled --> Idle : Operation Cancelled

@enduml
